OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will be a fresher day
OL,6,Fwith a gentle northwesterly wind,
OL,7,Falthough it could be gusty along
OL,8,Fhigher ground to the north. There will
OL,9,Fbe some pleasantly warm spells of
OL,10,Fsunshine, though the odd light shower
OL,11,Fcannot be ruled out.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe odd light shower could
OL,14,Faffect western coasts overnight,
OL,15,Fthough most inland areas will be dry
OL,16,Fwith clear spells and patchy cloud. A
OL,17,Fcomfortable night, with temperatures
OL,18,Flower than recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
