OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FIsolated showers are possible
OL,6,Fduring the morning, but most of these
OL,7,Fwill die out into the afternoon.
OL,8,FOtherwise there will be sunny spells
OL,9,Fand feeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells on Saturday with the odd light
OL,13,Fshower, mainly in the north. Generally
OL,14,Fdry and bright on Sunday. A chance of
OL,15,Fshowery rain developing on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
